<title>INDIA: Indian July steel output rises to 1.18 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian July steel output rises to 1.18 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian steel output rose to 1.18 million tonnes in July compared to 1.13 million in the same month in 1995, the government said.</p>
<p>    STEEL OUTPUT   July     July	Apr-July    Apr-July</p>
<p>			 1996     1995	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p>			 1.18     1.13	 4.50	   4.30</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in millions of tonnes and preliminary. They cover India's main plants.</p>
</text>
